# The program of ../../answers is one in which types are checked at entry, functions are split behind those checks and have a generic version, checks become guards, and positions that may hold something else are marked.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: compile
# STATISTIC: FunctionsSplitBehindEntryChecks >= 1
# STATISTIC: GenericVersionsBehindEntryChecksCompiled >= 1
# STATISTIC: ChecksReplacedByGuards >= 1
# STATISTIC: TaintedPositions >= 1
# STATISTIC: StretchCopiesToEndOfFunction >= 1
# CHECK: image not empty
# PROGRAM-OF: ../../answers/restarted-typed-function-keeps-arguments.ir
